      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ANJO PRINCESS (5) has a strong record this track and trip with six wins and four placings from 14 starts. Hit the frame latest (17.69) when third at Lithgow in a NG. Has the ability and should feature. SWEET CITY HALO (7) is a promising type who notched her 5th career success when too good (18.33) at this track last time. Has a strong winning record here. Winner at her latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Hard to fault her recent form and can win again. RED ROCK ALONG (1) produced a moderate run last time when fifth at this track over 320m behind Hard Right (18.67) in a Grade 5. Was in the money the start prior. Form from his last run is proving strong. Likely to be thereabouts. SECRET BULLET (4) won with authority last start. Big chance on that form.",
